invalid type: string "5. How to Claim Warranty\nTo initiate a warranty claim, customers must:\n  1. Contact our support team at support@novatech.com or call 1800-NOVA-TECH\n  2. Provide proof of purchase (invoice or order number)\n  3. Describe the defect or issue in detail\n  4. Ship the product to our authorized service center (shipping charges may apply)\nPage 1 | NovaTech Solutions Pvt. Ltd."ÿ